---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
// A site-owned snapshot: the build does not require the app repository.
import { Content } from '../content/whitepaper.md';
---
<Layout title="Whitepaper · Tinline" description="How Tinline works: identity, transport, signed conversations, groups, calls, receipts, storage and limits. Each part is marked shipped, designed or not built.">
  <main id="main" class="shell prose-page wide">
    <p class="eyebrow">WHITEPAPER · DRAFT</p>
    <aside class="note">
      <p>Tinline is an experiment from Osvauld in messaging with minimal shared infrastructure: locally created identities, conversations held on devices, and a small wake service for supported phones. This paper describes how it works, and marks each part as shipped, designed or not built yet.</p>
    </aside>
    <div class="prose"><Content /></div>
  </main>
</Layout>
